## AI models

Models are accessed over an OpenAI-compatible gateway and are **not** bundled or
redistributed with this repository. Only the case's allowed model list is used:

- `google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it` — extraction (A2) and reasoning (A6)
- `z-ai/glm-5.3-flash` — failover reasoning
- `deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash` — available reasoning model
- `moonshotai/kimi-k2.6` — long-context reasoning
- `qwen/qwen3-vl-30b-a3b-instruct` — vision OCR for scanned research PDFs

Each model is governed by its provider's own terms of use.

