## External news sources (runtime collection)

`pipelines/ingest_news.py` can collect publicly available news at runtime from
free, legally reusable endpoints configured in
[`config/news_sources.yaml`](config/news_sources.yaml): the Moscow Exchange ISS
open API, the Bank of Russia public XML feed, and the public RSS/Atom feeds of
ТАСС, Интерфакс, Коммерсантъ, Ведомости and РБК. Only item metadata (title,
summary, link, date) is stored. HTML scraping is opt-in, honors `robots.txt`,
identifies the client via User-Agent and rate-limits per host. No content is
bundled or redistributed in this repository.

## Product catalog

`config/products.yaml` lists native bank products for the large-business
segment. Product names and short taglines are reproduced from the public
alfabank.ru business menu for a hackathon prototype; links are placeholders. No
Alfa-Bank marketing artwork or copyrighted copy beyond the short product names
and taglines is bundled.

## Services and simulated integrations

- OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway endpoints configured via `LLM_BASE_URL` /
