- No external AI, OCR or multi-agent service is used as a core component.

## Visual design

The color palette was sampled from the public `alfabank.ru` website for a
hackathon prototype. No Alfa-Bank or Stripe logos, illustrations, proprietary
fonts or copyrighted assets are bundled. The gradient mesh
(`frontend/public/mesh.svg`) is an original asset created for this project. The
UI structure is inspired by a public design analysis and does not reproduce any
proprietary design system.
